==English==
{{wikipedia|borscht}}

===Etymology===
1884 or 1808. {{etyl|yi}} {{term|בארשט|באַרשט|tr=borsht|sc=Hebr|lang=yi}}, from {{etyl|ru}} or {{etyl|uk}} {{term|борщ|tr=boršč}}.

===Alternative spellings===
* [[borsch]]
* [[borshch]]
* [[borsht]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/bɔrʃt/}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(r)ʃt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# A [[beetroot]]/[[beet]] [[soup]] that can be [[serve]]d hot or cold, usually with [[sour cream]].

